                               E('Basal insulin is continued when NPO but at 80% (22 x 0.8 = 17.6, about 18 units) because skipping it lets glucose and ketones rise (infection, healing); full dose with no food risks hypoglycemia, worse with CKD (slower insulin clearance); the glargine order still says 22 units, so clarify before the bedtime dose.', 0.4, ''),
